    "_error_map_note": "Story 33.2: connector-local normalization copies HubSpot category to code before core classification while preserving the original sanitized payload. Category-specific manifest entries therefore fire; malformed/category-free responses retain HTTP-status fallback. This normalization feeds core _extract_provider_code through the conventional code field.",
